# Odd one for 3 players: the rule mode, then the task mode (a long card), the rules
#! app party
RIGHT RIGHT 5 shot menu
DOWN 5 shot settings
DOWN 5 3 CENTER RSOFT UP 5 5 shot rule1
5 5 shot rule2
5 5 shot rule3
5 5 shot talk
5 shot answer
RSOFT DOWN 5 5 shot modes
DOWN 5 RSOFT UP 5 5 shot task1
5 5 shot task2
5 5 shot task3
5 5 shot task_talk
5 shot task_answer
RSOFT DOWN DOWN 5 shot rules
